<h2 id="qigong-monthly">Online Monthly Qigong Series</h2>

<div class="shared-story">
<p>Month-long structured programmes, meeting twice weekly. Each programme covers specific Qigong forms and practices, building progressively over the weeks. Suitable for all levels.</p>
</div>

<h3>What You Will Learn</h3>
<ul class="features">
<li>Authentic Qigong forms taught with precision and depth</li>
<li>Internal energy work - using the Yi (mind) to guide the Qi</li>
<li>Correct posture, alignment and breathing techniques</li>
<li>Understanding of meridian pathways and acupuncture points relevant to each form</li>
<li>Self-care practices you can continue between sessions and after the course</li>
</ul>

<h3>Format</h3>
<ul class="features">
<li>4 weeks, twice weekly</li>
<li>Live guidance with pre-recorded elements</li>
<li>Delivered via Zoom</li>
<li>Open to participants anywhere in the world</li>
<li>New courses run regularly</li>
</ul>

<p>For pricing and availability, please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>

