<h2 id="200h-qigong-teacher-training">200-Hour Online Qigong Teacher Training</h2>

<div class="shared-story">
<p>A comprehensive programme for those who want to teach authentic Qigong with precision and depth. This training covers the full breadth of Qigong theory, practice and teaching methodology needed to guide students with confidence and integrity.</p>
</div>

<h3>Programme Includes</h3>
<ul class="features">
<li>Five-Element Qigong forms - theory and practice</li>
<li>Extraordinary-Meridian Qigong forms</li>
<li>Shen (higher awareness) Qigong forms</li>
<li>Zhan Zhuang standing practices</li>
<li>Traditional Chinese Medicine foundations as they relate to Qigong</li>
<li>Meridian pathways, acupuncture points and the Five Elements</li>
<li>Teaching methodology and class structure</li>
<li>Practicum and mentored teaching practice</li>
</ul>

<h3>Format</h3>
<ul class="features">
<li>200 hours of training</li>
<li>Live guidance with pre-recorded elements</li>
<li>Delivered via Zoom</li>
<li>Open to participants anywhere in the world</li>
</ul>

<h3>Who Is This For</h3>
<ul class="features">
<li>Those who want to teach authentic Qigong</li>
<li>Existing teachers looking to add genuine Qigong to their offering</li>
<li>Dedicated practitioners who want a deeper understanding of the art</li>
<li>No prior Qigong experience is essential, but an open mind, patience and willingness to learn are important</li>
</ul>

<p>For pricing and availability, please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>

